# Dev-only fallback: copy to .env.local and fill in. The key is read by the
# Vite dev-server proxy (vite.config.ts) and never reaches browser code; it is
# used only when no API key is set in the UI (KEY button in the header).
# Alternative: skip this file and use the ant CLI instead — see "API access" in the README.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
